WEBVTT

00:08:59.952 --> 00:09:02.454
and you're not stupid,
you just don't have the tools.

00:09:02.496 --> 00:09:03.998
Then you drop out.

00:09:04.039 --> 00:09:06.750
Pregnancy, of course, and family poverty.

00:09:08.043 --> 00:09:11.046
And one thing that came out
of that data collection

00:09:11.088 --> 00:09:15.342
is all of the girls say,
“We need a safe space.

00:09:16.093 --> 00:09:18.971
We need a place where
we can talk to one another

00:09:19.013 --> 00:09:22.182
and we can work together
and support one another."

00:09:22.474 --> 00:09:23.892
I said, "It's done."

00:09:24.268 --> 00:09:26.604
So we start creating the girl club

00:09:26.645 --> 00:09:30.608
and built a curriculum
based on their need.